```
# 懵然不知
(pos:成語 / 動詞)
<explanation>
yue:完全唔知道發生緊嘅事；對周圍嘅情況一啲都唔察覺。
eng:completely unaware; totally ignorant of what is happening
<eg>
yue:佢哋兩個拍咗拖好耐，但我仲係懵然不知。 (keoi5 dei6 loeng5 go3 paak3 zo2 to1 hou2 noi6, daan6 ngo5 zung6 hai6 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:They have been dating for a long time, but I was completely unaware of it.

<eg>
yue:啲騙徒偷咗佢啲錢，佢仲懵然不知。 (di1 pin3 mou4 tau2 zo2 keoi5 di1 cin2, keoi5 zung6 mung2 jin4 bat1 zi1.)
eng:The scammers stole his money, and he was still totally oblivious to it.
``` [end of text]


